  "details": "初めてにおすすめ！のワールドが古く日本人におすすめめなのかも怪しいです。\n\nもっといいワールドがある！\n\n特にVRC-JP 初心者プラザ ジェイプラが説明文が丁寧で日本人も多いのでおすすめです！\n\nどのような理由で掲載されているのかもわからないため、調整してほしいです。\n\n少なからず、SuRroomやメゾン荘201号室には初心者がいるかも怪しいです。\n\n日本の初心者のためにも導線の見直しをご要望いたします。\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7345f139-e021-45cb-986e-b8b0f43994fa/info\n\n---\n\nThe recommended \"beginner-friendly\" world seems outdated, and it's questionable whether it's actually suitable for Japanese users.\n\nThere are definitely better worlds out there!\n\nIn particular, VRC-JP Beginner Plaza (J-Plaza) is highly recommended because its description is thorough and there are many Japanese users.\n\nSince it's unclear why certain worlds are listed, we would appreciate adjustments.\n\nAt the very least, it's doubtful that beginners can be found in SuRroom or Maison Sou 201.\n\nFor the sake of Japanese beginners, we request a review of the user flow.\n\nLink to the world\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7345f139-e021-45cb-986e-b8b0f43994fa/info",
